sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: 从建立连接到结束一轮
  accDescr: 先协商，再建立会话。prompt 响应只描述本轮协议终态。
  autonumber
  participant client as 客户端
  participant agent as ACP 代理
  participant core as Core 会话
  client->>agent: initialize
  client->>agent: session/new 或 load
  agent->>core: 创建或恢复会话
  client->>agent: session/prompt
  core-->>agent: 运行事件
  agent-->>client: session/update
  agent-->>client: prompt 响应
